<title>POLAND: Polish unemployment falls to 13.0 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Polish unemployment falls to 13.0 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland fell to 13.0 percent of the workforce in March from 13.4 percent in February, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.  </p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	MARCH	FEBRUARY    MARCH 96</p>
<p> number of jobless million	2.236	2.312	  2.726</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    13.0	 13.4	    15.4</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
